# Root build context is shared by every service compose builds with `context: .`
# (digikey, digigraph, digiquant, digitrace, digiclaw, digichat). Their
# Dockerfiles COPY the service source dirs, so exclude only what no image needs.
.git
.github
# digiquant-runner house-run reads only these two files. The rest of .github stays out.
!.github/digiquant-pipeline.yml
!.github/workflows/pipeline-digiquant-allocation-shadow.yml
.worktrees
.claude
.playwright-mcp
node_modules
**/node_modules
# Host virtualenvs are not the image. uv sync builds /app/.venv.
**/.venv
**/.next
**/out
dist
data
docs
projects
openspec
tests
scripts
# Dockerfile.digithings-stack-cloudflare (Cloudflare Containers, root context)
# needs this one file; re-include it without un-ignoring the rest of scripts/.
!scripts/merge_litellm_cheaperinference.py
# digiquant-runner (Dockerfile.digiquant-runner) runs this refresh entrypoint.
!scripts/refresh_market_data_r2.py
# refresh dynamically loads this sibling for R2StoreAdapter / parquet helpers.
!scripts/backfill_market_data_r2.py
# execution-cron-check probe wrapper (Phase 2, #4761).
!scripts/execution_cron_check.py
# checkpoint-archive (Phase 4, #4761).
!scripts/digiquant_archive_checkpoints.py
!scripts/digiquant_checkpoint_size_gate.py
# Zammad MCP server (scripts/zammad_mcp/Dockerfile.mcp) also builds from the
# root context; re-include just that package.
!scripts/zammad_mcp
# scripts/index_occ_tickets.py is NOT copied into the stack image (DIG-1438
# dropped [program:seed_occ_tickets], its only caller). The re-include stays
# because DIG-1210 still has to change what this script writes.
# (tests/scripts/test_stack_dockerignore_context.py pins this re-include, but it
# is on `main` only — it does not exist on develop, so do not cite it as the
# gate here.)
!scripts/index_occ_tickets.py
agents
apps/digithings-web
apps/digiquant-web
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
